    "Register your interest": "登记您的意向",
    "Privacy notice": "隐私声明",
    "What this site collects, where it goes, how long it stays and how to get it removed.": "本网站收集的内容、存储位置、保留时间以及如何删除。",
    "Last updated 2026. This notice covers the summit website only.": "最后更新于2026年。本声明仅涵盖峰会网站。",
    "What is collected": "收集的内容",
    "Only what you type into a form on this site: your name, email address, and optionally your organisation, job title, country, registration category and message.": "仅限您在本网站表单中输入的内容:您的姓名、电子邮件地址,以及可选的您的机构、职位、国家、注册类别和留言。",
    "Alongside each submission the system records a small amount of technical context used to detect automated spam: the country your request came from, your browser's user-agent string, and the page you submitted from. Your IP address is <strong>not</strong> stored — for rate limiting it is converted to a one-way hash that cannot be turned back into an address.": "系统会在每次提交时记录少量用于检测自动垃圾信息的技术上下文:您的请求来源国家、浏览器的用户代理字符串以及您提交的页面。您的IP地址<strong>不会</strong>被存储——为了进行速率限制,它会被转换为无法还原为地址的单向哈希值。",
    "What is not collected": "不收集的内容",
    "No advertising or cross-site tracking cookies.": "不使用广告或跨网站跟踪Cookie。",
    "No third-party analytics that profile you. Site analytics are aggregate page counts only, with no cookie and no individual identifier.": "不使用对您进行画像的第三方分析工具。网站分析仅为汇总页面计数,不使用Cookie,也不使用个人标识符。",
    "No data brokers, no list rental, no sale of any kind.": "不向数据中介机构提供,不出租名单,不以任何形式出售。",
    "Where it goes": "数据去向",
    "Stored in": "存储于",
    "Cloudflare D1, a database controlled by the summit secretariat": "Cloudflare D1,由峰会秘书处控制的数据库",
    "Email delivery": "电子邮件发送",
    "Brevo, used to send your confirmation and notify the secretariat": "Brevo,用于发送您的确认信息并通知秘书处",
    "Spam protection": "垃圾信息防护",
    "Cloudflare Turnstile": "Cloudflare Turnstile",
    "Who can read it": "谁可以读取",
    "The summit secretariat, its appointed organiser, and the processors named above": "峰会秘书处、其指定的组织方以及上述处理方",
    "Cloudflare and Brevo are processors, not independent controllers: they hold and route this information under contract, on the secretariat's instructions, and do not use it for their own purposes.": "Cloudflare和Brevo是处理方,而非独立控制方:它们根据合同、按照秘书处的指示持有和传输此信息,不将其用于自身目的。",
    "How long it is kept": "保存期限",
    "Registration and enquiry records are kept until the end of the summit and for twelve months afterwards, so the secretariat can contact you about the next edition. After that they are deleted. Spam-detection rate-limit records are discarded within the hour.": "注册和查询记录将保留至峰会结束后的十二个月,以便秘书处就下一届峰会与您联系。之后这些记录将被删除。垃圾信息检测速率限制记录将在一小时内删除。",
    "Your choices": "您的选择",
    "You can ask to see what is held about you, ask for it to be corrected, or ask for it to be deleted entirely. Use the <a href=\"/contact/\">contact form</a> and say which. Requests are actioned rather than negotiated.": "您可以要求查看关于您的信息、要求更正信息或要求完全删除信息。请使用<a href=\"/contact/\">联系表单</a>并说明您的要求。我们会直接执行请求而非进行协商。",
    "Confirmation emails are transactional — they are the receipt for something you submitted. Any future announcement emails carry an unsubscribe link, and unsubscribing does not remove your registration.": "确认电子邮件属于交易性邮件——它们是您所提交内容的回执。未来的任何公告电子邮件都会包含取消订阅链接,取消订阅不会删除您的注册信息。",
    "Security": "安全",
    "The site is served over HTTPS only, with a content security policy that blocks third-party scripts. Form submissions are validated and rate-limited. No payment details are handled anywhere on this site, because the site takes no payments.": "本网站仅通过HTTPS提供服务,并采用阻止第三方脚本的内容安全策略。表单提交经过验证并受速率限制。本网站不处理任何支付详情,因为本网站不接受任何付款。",
    "Contact details pending": "联系详情待定",
    "A named data contact and postal address will be published here once the secretariat confirms them. Until then the <a href=\"/contact/\">contact form</a> is the route for any privacy request, and those requests are handled the same way.": "一旦秘书处确认,将在此处公布具名的数据联系人和邮政地址。在此之前,<a href=\"/contact/\">联系表单</a>是提出任何隐私请求的途径,这些请求将以相同方式处理。",
    "Privacy requests": "隐私请求",
